  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I do understand why the ranking are this strict. But making them THIS strict is creating the opposite effect on the few people that are trying to optimize their models. Specifically on the polycount. Asking 10k poly for an avatar that would be used for fallback is extremely more demanding  than 15k, something that is 1/3 more the amount. I am no expert 3d modeller but so are most people. It really frustrate me I am unable to reach what we call good rating without doing huge sacrifice to my model. Just those 5000 poly can give so much more freedom.",
